  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十二关（前）\n时间未知 \\ 天气未知 \\ 能见度 低\n切尔诺伯格 行动组E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}营救行动 最终撤退阶段"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "可恶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "明明已经在出口了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这么轻松就想离开切尔诺伯格......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你们的白日梦，总该有人来戳醒吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "通讯设备已经恢复，我联系上了接应的行动预备组，他们正准备与我们汇合！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "可是，这个家伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "小心她手中的爆破物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "但是，我还是联系不上侦查小组！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "——你究竟是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你不认识我很正常——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不过，我认识你身边那个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "整合运动......还要，继续战斗吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉唉，别这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我和那个塔露拉龙女可合不来。毕竟我并不是专职守门的人啊。做完了自己的工作赶过来也是很累的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "为了搞好关系，我们互换姓名吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你可以叫我——W。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "为了见你身边那个人，我在这里可是等了好久呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "——博士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Dr.{@Nickname}......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我有些问题想要问问{@Nickname}，能不能请各位把他......直接送给我呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "你在浪费你自己的时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "——别急嘛。我也有些你们会感兴趣的情报哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "其实，我们刚刚遇到了不少身手很利落的家伙......和你们的穿着打扮差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "虽然做过伪装，但也就是骗骗乌萨斯人的程度，这点小把戏，可是难不倒我的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "侦察小队的各位吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "太好了......他们平安无——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "小兔子，你就是他们的组织者吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我很想知道，你究竟有什么魔力......能让他们都心甘情愿，毫无价值地为你送命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "什么......你想说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "没错，他们——没有一个人能跟着你回去哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你真的......配得上别人的牺牲吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "别管她，出口就在前方！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米娅......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你的行为，有什么意义吗，W？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "还没轮到你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "阿米娅......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "————你。生气了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......你不该说这种话。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "好啊，好啊......就该这样嘛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "来吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "整合运动的W，你不该说这种话！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "每个人的生命，都有价值......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "这不是你能玷污的事！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛，准备战斗！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哼哼......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
